"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:111731","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"天門","creatorId":"vndb:s1103","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:2602","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1103","name":"天門","roleCode":"music","roleLabel":"作品音乐","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:111732","source":"egs"}],"other":[{"creditedName":"御影","creatorId":"vndb:s957","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s957","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s957","name":"御影","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:48170","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c1585","characterName":"麻生 蓮治","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c1585"},"originalCharacterName":"麻生 蓮治","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1101"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"159"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"50"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Renji Asou who is half German, half Japanese is a protagonist of the third chapter in Ef: The Latter Tale."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"One day, when he goes to an abandoned train station where he often spends time, he meets a girl wearing an eyepatch over her left eye and sitting alone. The girl is Chihiro Shindo, the younger twin sister of Kei Shindo."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Despite both of them being mutually shy, Renji comes back to see her at the station every day after school and quickly becomes friends with her."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"He later learns that she has a severe case of anterograde amnesia where she cannot remember anything past thirteen hours previous, aside from the events before the accident which she can recall perfectly."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Renji also finds out that her dream is to write a fantasy novel, but due to her condition Chihiro has never been able to get far. Renji loves to read novels, and after discussing it with Chihiro, he collaborates with her to see if he can finally make her dream come true. Through the process of writing the novel, the two eventually become very close and they fall in love with each other. As the story progresses and more of the novel is written, Renji soon discovers that the novel is an allegory for Chihiro's life and how she sees the world around her due to the state of her limited memory."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1585"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6d/6da477a41d6dce60411f57950331c3eafef27c0bd91b4b1faf155f1c6071adc8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/71/7107b5e2e824e4b1ab940b68867afd9704542acd0fac99b92faf5ee7d32a9462.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"伊香川 椎音","creatorId":"vndb:s487","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s487","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s487","name":"高城 元気","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:26722","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c1586","characterName":"新藤 千尋","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c1586"},"originalCharacterName":"新藤 千尋","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"602"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"77"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"151"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"78"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"53"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"38"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"”Today, let me tell you a story about a rabbit.”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The younger of the identical twins. Very literary. She’s naturally quiet, the polar opposite of her sister Kei. Though she appears calm and collected, she seems childish when spoken to, and is a bit of an airhead. Due to a childhood accident, she lost her left eye and bears a unique handicap."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She does not currently attend school, and would appear to be under recuperation. Has the habits of glancing up at people and of tilting her head."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From MangaGamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1586"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9b/9b1c2002ce61cbb004817c0e6441c10510991bc174c06116e615e4c8c76763e4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bf/bfc05ec2b0953af0d860a1f723d40cd8039f484a95615dfaf8bd91103170cf55.webp","width":209,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"まき いづみ","creatorId":"vndb:s365","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s365","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s365","name":"やなせ なつみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:26714","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c1592","characterName":"広野 紘","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c1592"},"originalCharacterName":"広野 紘","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"909"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"165"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"52"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"”You’ll never know if you don’t try.”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hiro is a full-time student, but moonlights as Shindou Nagi, a professional shoujo manga artist. He is the youngest sibling in a family where his father and sister are both renowned traditional artists. At his core he’s diligent and softhearted, but his outer personality shows otherwise. He communicates bluntly and has difficulty speaking his mind."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He can also be indecisive. He is influenced by his sister, the Shindou twins (particularly the older one), and countless others, and has poor luck with women in general."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From MangaGamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1592"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0a/0ab432969a76878e565846688060daa4bbab7d6bbab2d207557be0208f3075e2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b9/b9d320cf371e5db03a98be4e25b7d032a63e8ea4332985b14e42faf0797dbff7.webp","width":209,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小満 皐","creatorId":"vndb:s70","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s70","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s70","name":"下野 紘","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:26716","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c1593","characterName":"宮村 みやこ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c1593"},"originalCharacterName":"宮村 みやこ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"908"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"88"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"162"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"83"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"57"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"47"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"”Wha-a-at? Being a copycat is so boring!”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Boasting excellence in all facets, she is attractive, has top grades, and is quite athletic. She is, however, known to those around her for being whimsical and selfish."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She hates being tied down, so skipping class and going home early is simply routine for her. Although most matters are uninteresting to her, she’ll relentlessly seize anything that takes her fancy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She’s a troublemaker and sets her own terms."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From MangaGamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1593"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/07/079a51219f07535941c951903f6885621e3bf25bd917f8597b52e9e0b89f54ed.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/da/da52bb0816198f6f29baa747dc109ece3823496d4644a0148b054668765290a9.webp","width":209,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"赤沢 かえで","creatorId":"vndb:s5","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5","name":"田口 宏子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:26713","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c1594","characterName":"新藤 景","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c1594"},"originalCharacterName":"新藤 景","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"602"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"76"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"150"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"79"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"55"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"40"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"”Onii-chan? I won’t get mad, so tell me.”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The elder of a set of identical twins. Very athletic. A first-year student, Kei is already a starter for the basketball team. She’s determined to win, knows no fear, and is a sadist. Due to the influence of Hirono Hiro, her ”Onii-chan” and friend since they were little, she’s developed a sharp tongue and talks like a man when she gets worked up."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Proud and somewhat reckless, she gets embarrassed whenever she messes up. She is also not adept in romantic affairs, and has a tendency to believe in fortunes."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From MangaGamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1594"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8c/8ccca20bdd9f979c3e04606af27b05b753131fda087d351fce640938d0fd266a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b4/b4117f67f88bc124eda6d66daa1f2a661dcd09aeb819f30d0bfc8b3e362f8d32.webp","width":209,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"桜井 美鈴","creatorId":"vndb:s1120","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1120","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1120","name":"岡田 純子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:26721","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c1595","characterName":"堤 京介","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c1595"},"originalCharacterName":"堤 京介","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1129"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"171"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"60"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"”Nothing in it for me for helping a guy. Now if you were a girl...”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A cameraman in the film club. Aloof, and perhaps nimble in nature. Particularly so when it comes to women. He has a keen sense of observation, possibly stemming from his diplomatic role with the club. He is devoted and meticulous regarding his surroundings, and has been involved in many relationships. However, he is selfish when it comes to filming, and at times can be stubborn, turning the sorrow of others into material."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"At present, he has a keen interest in the love triangle involving his close friend Hirono Hiro."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From MangaGamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1595"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b3/b34f10abf03cea0e5b88523a8c33feeb24554bf62f154383d1e749923e379b2c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1f/1f59d304586695a97a4ba006fc932ddaa42c4658eb820b133d29f4a7bc32b122.webp","width":209,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"城樹 翔","creatorId":"vndb:s1124","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1124","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1124","name":"泰 勇気","roleCode":"voice-actor","rol