","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"57"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"46"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the older sister of Hirono Hiro and has a talent for painting. Her brother uses her name for his work as a mangaka. She likes to paint herself nude, but lost her ability to draw because she felt alone for some time. She regains her ability to draw later and she is some kind of art teacher for Himuro Yuu, who she loved back at high school. She was engaged with Kuze for a short time and is a friend of Mizuki later. Her character is energetic but also very kind. She has short brown hair, brown eyes and wears glasses in the present time of the second ef story."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From MyAnimeList"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c59654"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a7/a7a296d60715ab4d5f824cc8c14fca16771add99f311db2784f18fdcfa556893.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c0/c057ff012139a8f92556dfb759498f364e6a2f00313f3987bcd14c8bafaac8ae.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"三咲 里奈","creatorId":"vndb:s516","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s516","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s516","name":"伊藤 静","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:26718","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c59655","characterName":"雨宮 明里","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c59655"},"originalCharacterName":"雨宮 明里","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Akari is a music teacher, who is very popular among the students, which are even creates their own fan clubs for her."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c59655"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1e/1e692eb7273015aff85ec5dbb66c09ea7e879fc125da6a3e62a4a28a2797d83a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/84/847d98f26299ce9ef8d2e3fb7721a85ae513c5b9e512687b11657a43925a55a4.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c59814","characterName":"雨宮 明良","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c59814"},"originalCharacterName":"雨宮 明良","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"810"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"173"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"62"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The art teacher of the high school Himura attended. Despite being a teacher in the school, he breaks the rules and smokes within the facility. As an art teacher, he repeatedly provokes Himura to join the art club."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Akira lost his sister in an earthquake (coincidentally, the earthquake that killed Akira's sister was also the earthquake that killed Himura's sister). Thus, in hopes that Yuuko would replace his biological sister, he adopted Yuuko, who is a splitting image of his biological sister. Akira was initially very happy and treated Yuuko like a princess because he had Yuuko who would replace his biological sister. However, as time went by, he slowly realized that Yuuko was not his sister and began to despise her. Thus, he began to abuse her physically and sexually."},{"spoile